Build the tool from generated Go source with buildGoModule and a vendorHash of
null, the same shape the http example uses. Name the artifact logscan.

This tool carries no configuration: every filter comes from the command line at
runtime, so no environment variable and no wrapper are needed. Put the bare
binary on PATH with environment.systemPackages holding ${artifact.logscan}. Do
not use a systemd service.

Read standard input line by line with the standard library JSON decoder. No
external dependency of any kind.
